B = [
('American Motors','North America','1970s','cars','In the style of American Motors, quirky, offbeat 1970s American pragmatism with a stubby, short-tailed body, a long front with one bold central raised scoop and a chopped tail that ends in a flat cut-off. Square-shouldered edges with bulging haunches, plain black plastic bumpers, small round lamps set in a wide mesh face, and sticker-style lettering along the side. Bold red, white and blue stripe sets, mag-style steel wheels, plaid fabric in orange and brown, woodgrain panels and oversized colour-matched round rims. Loud colours of bright orange, vivid green, mustard and avocado. Practical, rebellious and cheerfully strange.'),
('Rivian','North America','2020s','cars','In the style of Rivian, rugged, friendly modern adventure design with a tall rounded-rectangle body, a smooth closed face with no grille, and a pair of stadium-shaped vertical lamps joined by one thin line of light. Heavy black plastic cladding wraps the lower edges and around the openings, with short overhangs, a high stance and chunky wheels with turbine-like faces. Matte paint in forest green, lake blue, limestone and glacier white. Warm natural wood, recycled felt, simple clean shapes and one large screen. Outdoorsy, capable, clean and approachable.'),
('Toyota','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Toyota, sensible, dependable mass-market design given a sharp modern edge. An angular, crisp-edged face with a large glossy black hourglass opening low down, thin swept lamps with a hooked inner line, and a sculpted upper surface. Clean slab sides with one crisp shoulder crease, smooth coupe-like top line, compact C-shaped rear lights and large black plastic trim around openings for a tougher feel. Dark grey multispoke wheels. Tidy grey fabric, soft-touch plastics, piano-black panels and a floating screen. Colours of super white, deep black, cool silver, red and bright blue. Reliable, sharp and tidy.'),
('Honda','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Honda, precise, light and clever 1990s and 2000s Japanese engineering shown through low, sleek fronts, wide thin grilles with a single small letter badge, thin swept-back wedge lamps and a low cab-forward cockpit with generous glass. Compact, tidy, rounded shapes with a cut-off squared tail and slim rear lights. Sporty versions add a red badge, a rear wing, a round exhaust and bright five-spoke alloy wheels. Clear white-on-black dials, a snug cockpit and a short shifter with a round knob. Colours of championship white, bright red, sunny yellow, black and silver. Eager, neat and high-revving.'),
('Nissan','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Nissan, energetic modern Japanese design with a bold V-shaped grille in chrome or gloss black, boomerang-shaped lamp pairs, and a floating roof effect created by blacked-out pillars. Sharp but flowing body lines with a kicked-up rise at the rear window, muscular flared haunches and a ribbed upper surface. A circular ring badge, round rear lights with a boomerang graphic, and sporty multispoke alloy wheels. Flat-bottomed round wheel, quilted stitching and a bright screen inside. Colours of pearl white, gunmetal, deep blue and bright orange. Dynamic, muscular and sharp.'),
('Datsun','East Asia','1970s','cars','In the style of Datsun, cheerful, honest 1970s Japanese small-scale design with a long, low, rounded front, a low oval mouth under thin chrome bumpers, round lamps in bright bezels and a short tidy fastback shape. Thin pillars, small rear lights, a black rubber insert in the bumper, plain hubcaps or five-slot steel wheels, side stripes and a small bright badge on the front wing. Utility versions are plain slab-sided with a chrome grille. Simple black vinyl, round white-on-black dials and a thin wheel with a horn ring. Colours of orange, lime yellow, sky blue and white. Compact, friendly and unpretentious.'),
('Mazda','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Mazda, elegant, sensual, clean design that uses soft flowing reflections rather than hard creases. A long front, a low cabin set far back, a large five-point grille crossed by a fine chrome wing, and narrow dark lamps with a sharp inner glare. Short smooth overhangs, a slim chrome line along the window edge, rounded rear lights with a single ring, and dark alloy wheels with machined faces. A thin horizontal dash, matte metal, red or white leather and a freestanding screen inside. Signature deep crystal red, machine grey and soft pearl tones. Calm, graceful and restrained.'),
('Subaru','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Subaru, purposeful, rugged, slightly aggressive rally-bred design with a hawk-eye or wing-shaped grille, swept lamps, a raised scoop on the upper front surface, a tall rear wing and flared arches. Practical boxy body, frameless door glass, short overhangs, big round driving lamps and a cluster of six stars as a badge. Gold-painted multispoke wheels. Plain dark fabric inside with bright blue or red stitching, bucket seats and simple round gauges. Colours of deep rally blue with gold accents, white, black and silver. Functional, tough and a little cheeky.'),
('Mitsubishi','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Mitsubishi, tough, boxy, motorsport-ready design with an aggressive nose, a wide lower intake mouth, narrow slanted lamps, big round driving lamps and a badge of three red diamonds. A large vent on the upper front surface, a big rear wing, pumped wheel arches, a short tail and multispoke white or gunmetal alloy wheels. Rugged variants add chunky plastic cladding and roof rails. Bucket seats, round dials and a grey plastic dash inside. Colours of white, red, silver and black with sporty decals. Hard-edged, purposeful and fast.'),
('Lexus','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Lexus, precise, exaggerated, sharp-featured Japanese luxury with a huge hourglass spindle opening filled with a fine mesh pattern, sharp angular lamps with L-shaped light signatures, and deeply creased flanks. A sharp line across the upper front and a low sleek coupe-like roof. A single bright oval badge, full-width connected rear light bar and large multispoke wheels with machined edges. Hand-stitched leather, origami-like pleated trim, a sweeping dash and a wide screen. Colours of sonic white, obsidian black, red mica and deep blue. Dramatic, polished and meticulous.'),
('Suzuki','East Asia','1980s-2000s','cars','In the style of Suzuki, cute, tiny, sturdy small-vehicle design with tall boxy shapes, big square windows, short fronts, and round or rectangular lamps in a simple plastic grille with a single stylised S badge. Tiny steel wheels with plastic covers. Rugged variants have a flat slab body, a canvas or hard top, a vertical slotted grille and a spare wheel on the back door. Plain fabric seats, a straight dash, big dials and a tall roof inside. Colours of bright red, pastel blue, yellow and white. Compact, cheerful and unfussy.'),
('Daihatsu','East Asia','1990s-2010s','cars','In the style of Daihatsu, cheerful, toylike miniature design with a boxy rounded body, tall roof, short front, round friendly lamps and a small smiling grille above a stylised D badge. Black plastic bumpers, plastic trim around the wheel openings, small wheels with plain hubcaps and big sliding doors. Two-tone pastel paint with a white roof. Bench seat, column shifter, large clear dials and sometimes pastel interior panels. Colours of mint green, baby pink, sky blue, cream and sunny yellow. Compact, sweet and playful.'),
('Hyundai','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Hyundai, futuristic, digital, geometric design with a sharp parametric look, a wide cascading grille with lamps hidden inside it, and pixel-shaped lights in small square blocks. Taut body surfaces folded with sharp creases like paper, flush door handles and a thin full-width rear light strip made of square dots. Pixel-pattern alloy wheels. Inside a two-spoke wheel, twin widescreen displays, soft grey or lime fabrics and a flat floor. Colours of sleek silver, bright white, cyber grey and deep teal. Crisp, techy and clean.'),
('Kia','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Kia, youthful, confident, sharp design with a tiger-nose grille framed by a slim body-coloured or black surround that flows into swept lamps. Sculpted low front, crisp sporty shoulder, rising window line, muscular rear haunches and wide rear light bars with star-map light patterns. A simple stylised oval wordmark, black-roof two-tone looks and wheels with turbine or aero faces in dark chrome. A curved panoramic display, soft-touch surfaces and bright accent colours inside. Colours of snow white, aurora black, sunset red, steel grey and lime. Energetic and bold.'),
('Genesis','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Genesis, rich, elegant, sleek luxury with a big crest-shaped grille filled with a diamond mesh pattern, a winged badge, and two thin horizontal lines of light in both front and rear lamps for a split twin-line signature. Long front, athletic stance, one flowing parabolic line running along the body side, a low roof and flush doors. Thin multispoke or mesh wheels. Quilted soft leather, knurled metal switches, a floating curved display and open-pore wood inside. Colours of matte grey, deep white, silver, deep green and copper. Poised, refined and understated.'),
('Tata Motors','South Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Tata Motors, robust, urban and friendly modern Indian design with a clean tall boxy body, a prominent upright grille with a flowing wedge of blue or chrome, and a split lamp arrangement with slim daytime strips above and main lamps below. A bold angular shoulder, black cladding around the wheel openings, roof rails, a strong squared stance and big geometric diamond-cut wheels. A swirling oval badge. Heavy-duty versions are brightly painted with tall flat cabs, square grilles and heavy bumpers. Floating tablet screen and contrast stitching inside. Colours of urban grey, pure white, flame red and deep black.'),
('Mahindra','South Asia','2000s-present','cars','In the style of Mahindra, tough, honest off-road design with a tall upright slab-sided body, a vertical seven-slot or multi-bar grille with a bold chrome ring, large round or squared lamps, a flat upper front, black plastic bumpers and a stubby short tail with the spare wheel on the rear door. Big square wheel arches, steel or chunky alloy wheels, running boards and a raised air intake. Big dials and simple fabric seats inside. Newer forms add a sharp twin-peak badge and twin-line LED lamps. Colours of deep black, white, bold red and dune beige. Rugged, stiff-stanced and blunt.'),
('Hindustan Motors','South Asia','1950s-1990s','cars','In the style of Hindustan Motors, stately, sturdy, dated 1950s British-inspired design with a rounded body, a bulbous domed roof, a tall rounded front with an upright chrome grille of vertical bars and a winged ornament on top. Separate round chrome lamps set on the front wings, rounded fenders, chrome bumpers, thin pillars, a big boot with a curved lid and small round rear lights. Painted steel wheels with chrome hubcaps. A wide bench seat, a plain metal dash with one big round speedometer and a thin wheel inside. Colours of ivory white, black, dull grey, taxi yellow and olive green.'),
('Lada','Russia and Eastern Europe','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Lada, frugal, dour, boxy Soviet-era design with a simple squared-off body made of flat panels, thin chrome bumpers, a plain chrome-framed grille with one horizontal bar, round or rectangular lamps with chrome rims and a small ship-shaped badge. Slim pillars, big glass areas, plain rectangular rear lights in orange and red, steel wheels with small chrome hubcaps, narrow tyres, upright stance and short overhangs. Brown or beige vinyl and brown plastic panels inside, a plain dash of round dials and a thin wheel. Colours of dusty pink, beige, ochre, brown, dark green and cherry red.'),
('Volga','Russia and Eastern Europe','1950s-60s','cars','In the style of Volga, dignified, plump, official mid-century Soviet design with a rounded pontoon body, a wide chrome mouth grille topped by a leaping animal ornament, round chrome lamps, bold chrome side trim with a stripe and a long boot with fine rounded fins in later forms. Large chrome bumpers, rim-style hubcaps, thin pillars and a wide wraparound rear window. A three-spoke wheel, wide bench seat, large dials and mottled plastic inside. Colours of ivory over pale green, dark grey and black for officials, light blue and cream with a chequer stripe for taxis.'),
('ZIL','Russia and Eastern Europe','1950s-70s','cars','In the style of ZIL, heavy, imposing, ceremonial and austere Soviet state grandeur, huge in length and width, with a heavy chrome grille of bold vertical bars, a wide bumper with big bullet guards, small round lamps, tall flat sides, thin chrome trim and a formal upright roofline. A stately slab body in black gloss, white sidewall tyres, tall chromed hubcaps and a bright star or hammer emblem. Wool broadcloth, lace curtains at the rear window, fold-down jump seats and massive wooden panels inside. Colours of black, deep burgundy, dark grey and cream.'),
('BYD','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of BYD, smooth, techy, friendly electric design with dragon-face or ocean-inspired styling, a wide closed nose, slim LED lamps drawn out into a sharp wing and a bright full-width rear light bar with a dotted pattern. Flush door handles, a rounded flowing body with a curved roof, a chrome accent strip across the nose and a stylised three-letter badge in bright metal. Aero alloy wheels with a leaf or blade pattern. A huge central screen that rotates between portrait and landscape, quilted leather and a floating console inside. Colours of arctic white, cosmos black, ocean blue, surf green and red.'),
('Hongqi','East Asia','1960s-present','cars','In the style of Hongqi, majestic, ceremonial and traditional Chinese state grandeur with a huge waterfall grille of tall chrome vertical bars, a flag-shaped red badge on the front, a long stately body, a formal upright roofline and rounded-square lamps. Early forms have a palace-lantern style rear light, thin pillars, white sidewall tyres, wide chrome bumpers and a large wheelbase. Modern forms add a flowing long front with a central ridge and a slim full-width rear light. Red wood, cream leather and silk-like fabrics inside. Colours of black, deep red, gold and ivory.'),
('Holden','Oceania','1970s','cars','In the style of Holden, tough, sunburnt, no-nonsense Australian muscle with a long front, a wide split grille with a lion-and-rolling-stone badge, round or square paired lamps and a flared body with a pronounced waist. Utility versions have a car front with a flat cargo tray. Sports versions carry a black stripe on the upper front, side stripes, a small rear spoiler and a bold number badge. Steel rally-style wheels or styled five-bolt steel wheels. Vinyl bucket seats, round gauges and a three-spoke wheel inside. Colours of hot red, bright yellow, sunset orange and dark green.'),
('Gurgel','Latin America','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Gurgel, small, toylike, rugged, home-made Brazilian utility design with a fibreglass body on a steel tube backbone, a boxy upright shape, a flat front and a high squared cabin with a doorless or canvas-top look. Round lamps in a plain recessed face, a short front with a simple slot grille, black bumpers, big rounded wheel arches, small steel wheels and small rear lights. Bare fibreglass, flat seats and a small dash inside. Colours of bright orange, lime green, bright yellow and sky blue in solid, shiny gelcoat.'),
('Volkswagen do Brasil','Latin America','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Volkswagen do Brasil, simple, sunny, pragmatic small-car design with a rounded boxy body, rear-engine air-cooled proportions, round lamps in chrome bezels, a small badge on the nose, thin chrome bumpers with rubber strips and rounded bubble pillars. Hot-weather details include pop-out quarter vents, tiny steel wheels with plain dish hubcaps and thin tyres. Open beach versions have a wide open body, bright paint and a bare dash. Colours of bright yellow, sandy beige, bright orange, green and mustard.'),
('Chanel','Europe','1920s-present','fashion','In the style of Chanel, understated Parisian luxury built on collarless boxy jackets in nubby, loosely woven tweed with contrast braid trim along every edge, a gold chain sewn into the hem for weight, and four patch pockets with gilt buttons embossed with interlocked double C marks. Palette of black, ivory white, navy, beige and soft pink. Clean knee-length simple dresses, two-tone beige and black shoes, long pearl ropes and white fabric camellia flowers as brooches. Quilted soft leather with diamond stitching, a flap with a rectangular turn lock and a chain interwoven with leather. Elegant, restrained, tailored and feminine, with monochrome rigour and gold accents.'),
('Dior','Europe','1947-1950s','fashion','In the style of Dior, the postwar silhouette of a tiny cinched waist, rounded sloping shoulders, emphasised bust and a voluminous calf-length skirt, pleated or cut as a full circle and built over stiff petticoats. Structured jackets in pale dove grey or black wool with padded hips, tulle and silk faille with sculpted bodices, floral embroidery and rosettes. Soft greys, pearl white, black, powder pink and tiny lily-of-the-valley motifs. Quilted lattice leather with a stitched diamond pattern and small dangling gold letter charms, houndstooth cloth, long white gloves and pearl earrings. Couture precision, ultra feminine, ladylike and opulent.'),
('Hermes','Europe','1920s-present','leather goods','In the style of Hermes, hand saddle-stitched leather with visible, slightly slanted double-thread stitching along crisp edges, in smooth calf, pebbled grain or fine textured leather in saturated orange, golden tan, black, deep red and deep blue. Structured trapezoid forms with a front flap, a slim strap with a small turn clasp, and a padlock with two keys hanging from a leather tag, in palladium or gold-plated metal. Square silk twill scarves with hand-rolled edges printed with riding, bridle and floral scenes in dense multicolour borders. Orange boxes with brown ribbon. Discreet minimal logos, exquisite craft and quiet wealth.'),
('Louis Vuitton','Europe','19th century-present','luggage','In the style of Louis Vuitton, heritage travel luxury with coated canvas covered in a repeating monogram of interlocking L and V letters alternating with four-petal flowers, diamonds and circled flowers in tan gold on rich brown, or a checkered pattern of brown and tan squares. Edges bound in natural leather that ages to honey, brass corner protectors, brass studs, heavy brass locks and clasps, rolled leather handles, rigid wooden frames and striped linings. Mustard-coloured stitching and gold embossed stamps. Soft slouchy shapes alongside structured ones. Rich, durable and well travelled.'),
('Gucci','Europe','1960s-present','fashion','In the style of Gucci, bold, sumptuous, eclectic luxury with a green and red stripe band running over beige and brown canvas, an interlocking double G monogram in repeating pattern, curved lacquered bamboo loops as handles, and a gold horsebit bar hardware detail. Vivid 1960s silk floral prints with butterflies and blooms. Maximalist phases add jewel-encrusted embroidery, tigers, snakes and bees, oversized glasses, velvet, pussy-bow blouses, bright colour clashes and 1970s flare. Glossy leather and gilt metal.'),
('Prada','Europe','1990s-present','fashion','In the style of Prada, severe, minimalist, intellectual luxury with matte black industrial nylon trimmed in cross-hatch textured leather and a small enamelled triangular metal plaque in silver. Pared-down sheath shapes, A-line skirts with flat fronts and boxy coats in muted mint green, olive, mustard, dusty pink, grey, brown and black, with deliberately off-beat colour pairings and retro 1950s patterns. Thick platform soles, chunky heels, clean seams, utilitarian pockets and ironic fur trim. Deadpan geometry and ugly-chic wit.'),
('Burberry','Europe','1900s-present','fashion','In the style of Burberry, weatherproof, tailored English refinement built on tan cotton gabardine with a double-breasted front, wide lapel, storm flap, shoulder epaulettes, a buckled belt with D rings and buckled cuff straps, plus a bold mounted knight emblem. A signature check of camel, black, white and red crossing lines forming a tartan-like grid, used as lining and on scarves. Mid-length belted shapes, fringed cashmere, wool capes and quilted layers. Palette of honey beige, stone, black and pillar-box red. Rainy city and countryside elegance.'),
('Barbour','Europe','1900s-present','outerwear','In the style of Barbour, rural, practical, weathered British field wear in waxed cotton in dark olive green, navy and tan with a slightly sticky, matte, oily surface that creases and fades at the folds. A dark brown corduroy collar, tartan wool lining, large patch pockets with storm flaps, hand-warmer pockets, heavy brass zips with leather pulls, press studs, a drawcord hem and rugged double-needle stitching. A diamond-quilted variant has ribbed cuffs. A small woven label sewn at the collar. Hunting, fishing and motorcycle heritage.'),
('Liberty London','Europe','Victorian-present','textiles','In the style of Liberty London, fine, silky, lightweight printed cotton with dense small-scale floral prints of tiny ditsy blooms, paisley, peacock feathers, vines and stylised Arts and Crafts leaves. Jewel tones of plum, teal, mustard, rose, sage and deep blue on cream or dark grounds. Fine line drawing, Art Nouveau curves and a hand-drawn quality, bias-bound edges, patchwork and lush velvets. A mix of English country garden and Oriental bazaar.'),
('Missoni','Europe','1960s-present','fashion','In the style of Missoni, knitted patterns of zigzag chevrons, flame stitch and wavy stripes, woven in rainbow colour gradients that blend from teal to orange, pink, purple, ochre and cream. Fine lightweight wool and rayon knit with crochet-like openwork, relaxed drape and stretch, flowing long shapes. Colours shift in tonal bands, creating bold yet soft optical vibrations. A 1970s bohemian luxury look.'),
('Versace','Europe','1980s-90s','fashion','In the style of Versace, flamboyant, opulent, high-shine glamour with gold classical head medallions as buttons, Greek key meander borders, baroque scrolls and acanthus leaf prints in gold, black, white and vivid jewel colours. Silk with clashing baroque prints, tight body-hugging shapes with deep plunging necklines, safety-pin details, studded leather, metal mesh like chain mail and gilt hardware. Bright pop colours of hot pink, turquoise and yellow. Sexy, high drama, a mix of Roman classicism and pop.'),
('Moschino','Europe','1980s-present','fashion','In the style of Moschino, witty, surreal, cheeky pop design with oversized graphic elements, heart shapes, question marks, peace signs, cartoon bears and balloon prints. Playful tailored shapes with giant buttons, fake dollar signs, tape measure and safety-pin trims, accessories shaped like everyday objects, and black and white stripes against bright red, yellow and pink. Bold lettering across fabric, couture cut with ironic parody.'),
('Emilio Pucci','Europe','1950s-60s','fashion','In the style of Emilio Pucci, lightweight, clingy, floaty silk jersey and chiffon printed with swirling kaleidoscopic psychedelic patterns of curving lines, arcs, petals and mosaic-like tiles in vivid aquamarine, hot pink, lime, violet, orange and turquoise, with a small sloped signature script woven into the print. Wide bell sleeves, scarf prints, a Capri resort mood and 1960s jet-set elegance.'),
('Salvatore Ferragamo','Europe','1930s-present','footwear','In the style of Salvatore Ferragamo, refined Italian craft with elegant slim shapes, a flat leather bow with a gold accent, bowed grosgrain ribbon trim, a wedge heel of cork covered in leather, platform soles in coloured suede, and patent and calfskin in navy, nude, red and black. Gold hook-shaped hardware at closures, delicate hand-stitched detail, a sculpted arch, shapely heels and soft pastel colours. Timeless Florentine elegance.'),
('Lacoste','Europe','1930s-present','sportswear','In the style of Lacoste, polished casual sport style with short-sleeved textured cotton pique, a small knit weave, a two or three button placket, a ribbed collar, and a small embroidered green crocodile on the left chest. Clean tennis whites plus navy, red, sky blue, green and yellow in solid colour blocks, a long tail hem and split side vents. White canvas shoes with the same small reptile mark and terry cloth bands. Sporty and preppy.'),
('Fred Perry','Europe','1950s-present','sportswear','In the style of Fred Perry, neat, tidy British youth style with slim-fit knitted pique cotton, a two-button placket, twin-tipped collar and sleeve cuff stripes in contrast colours such as navy with white and red, or black with yellow, and an embroidered laurel wreath on the left chest. Knit cardigans, track tops and white leather plimsolls. Mod and skinhead subculture heritage.'),
('Dr Martens','Europe','1960s-present','footwear','In the style of Dr Martens, chunky, durable, bold British rebellion in leather boots with a glossy black or cherry red finish, eight eyelets, a thick grooved bouncing rubber sole, a visible stitched welt in bright yellow thread and a yellow and black heel loop pull tab. Smooth polished leather or scuffed rugged finish, fat flat laces, platform soles and floral printed variants. Punk, grunge and working-class attitude.'),
('Levi Strauss','North America','1870s-present','fashion','In the style of Levi Strauss, American West workwear heritage in five-pocket indigo blue denim with orange thread double stitching, copper rivets at pocket corners, an arched double stitch design on the back pockets, a leather patch at the waistband showing two horses pulling apart, and a small red fabric tab sewn into a pocket seam. Straight legs, a button fly with embossed metal buttons, selvedge edges, faded whiskered wear and pleated chest pockets on jackets.'),
('Ralph Lauren','North America','1970s-present','fashion','In the style of Ralph Lauren, tasteful, nostalgic old-money country club and ranch look, American preppy and western heritage with slim shirts embroidered with a small galloping horseman and mallet, cable-knit sweaters in cream, navy and rich red with flag motifs, oxford button-down shirts, blazers with brass buttons, madras plaids, tartan, tweed, Fair Isle knits, rugged leather belts, boots and blanket-like geometric patterns. Warm colours of forest green, burgundy, camel and navy.'),
('Brooks Brothers','North America','1900s-present','fashion','In the style of Brooks Brothers, classic, understated, tidy American campus and boardroom polish with natural-shoulder sack suits in navy and grey flannel, soft rolled-collar button-down cloth shirts in white, pale blue and pink, ties of diagonal repp stripes, camel hair coats, blue and white seersucker stripe, madras jackets, penny loafers and a golden fleece emblem. Subdued colours and traditional tailoring.'),
('L.L.Bean','North America','1910s-present','outdoor','In the style of L.L.Bean, honest, practical New England woods look with rugged outdoor gear such as a rubber lower with a brown stitched leather upper and chain tread, canvas totes with contrasting colour handles and bottom trim in navy, red or green, flannel checks, chunky wool knits, hunting coats and fleece. Tough double stitching and earth tones of forest green, khaki, rust and cream.'),
('Patagonia','North America','1980s-present','outdoor','In the style of Patagonia, technical outdoor clothing with fuzzy synthetic pile fleece in colour-blocked panels of teal, red, mustard, navy and purple, zip chest pockets, nylon shells, short baggy shorts and a small rectangle logo of a jagged mountain skyline above a sunset gradient. Recycled materials, muted but vivid earthy hues, a soft pile texture, functional and minimal, with climbing and surf culture.'),
('Carhartt','North America','1900s-present','workwear','In the style of Carhartt, rugged American labourer workwear in heavy duck canvas in tobacco brown, black and faded tan, with triple-stitched seams, riveted stress points, quilted flannel lining, corduroy collars, bib overalls, double knees, folded-cuff knit caps, and a small square label in red and white or brown stitched on the chest or pocket. Stiff cotton that softens and fades with wear.'),
('Biba','Europe','1960s-70s','fashion','In the style of Biba, nostalgic, decadent, moody and glamorous London mod and Art Deco inspired fashion with short smock shapes, babydoll cuts, deep plum, rust, mushroom, dusty pink and chocolate brown tones, floppy brim hats, wide shoulders, ribbed sleeves, tight knit tops, small floral prints and heavy dark eye makeup. Wispy waifs, long bell sleeves, velvet, satin, and black and gold interiors with ostrich feathers.'),
('Mary Quant','Europe','1960s','fashion','In the style of Mary Quant, youthful, playful, clean-cut swinging sixties mod fashion with high mini hemlines and pinafore shapes, A-line cuts, shift shapes, bold geometric black and white checks and stripes, graphic colour blocking in bright red, yellow, orange and navy, white collars and cuffs, patent leather boots, coloured opaque tights, shiny PVC, a daisy logo with simple outline petals and a round centre, sharp bob haircuts and bold cat-eye makeup.'),
('Vivienne Westwood','Europe','1970s-present','fashion','In the style of Vivienne Westwood, theatrical, rebellious and romantic punk meets historical costume, with tartan in red and black, straps and zips, safety pins, corsets and bustiers, ruffled pirate shirts, hooped mini skirts, high platform shoes, draped asymmetrical jersey, an orb logo of a ringed globe with a cross in gold or silver, pearl chokers, gold sequins and pink and green accents. Torn, slashed and layered.'),
('Jean Paul Gaultier','Europe','1980s-present','fashion','In the style of Jean Paul Gaultier, cheeky, theatrical, camp couture craft with navy and white horizontal stripes, conical pointed satin bustiers with exaggerated cups, sailor motifs, tattoo-print mesh bodysuits, trench coats, kilts for men, pinstripe suits, mixing masculine and feminine codes, cinched waists and bold makeup, plus bottles shaped as a female torso in a tin can. French avant-garde.'),
('Adidas','Europe','1970s-present','sportswear','In the style of Adidas, clean, sporty, street-ready athletic wear with three parallel diagonal stripes down the sleeve or side seam, a trefoil logo of three leaves on a base, shell-toe leather sneakers in white with contrasting stripes in black, green or red, shiny nylon tracksuits in blue, red, black and white with zip stand collars and snap pants, retro 1970s terry polos, bold colour blocks and white gum soles.'),
('Puma','Europe','1960s-80s','sportswear','In the style of Puma, sleek, cool, 1970s and 80s sporty swagger with a curved swoosh-like band along the side, a leaping cat silhouette logo, soft suede in dark green, blue, red and black with a white stripe, low-profile cushioned soles, velour jackets with piped trim and ribbed cuffs, retro football boot shapes and colour blocking. Low, lean silhouettes, piped edges, glossy and matte contrasts, and a confident athletic attitude.'),
('Fjallraven','Europe','1960s-present','outdoor','In the style of Fjallraven, rugged, minimal, sensible Scandinavian northern forest feel with a small stylised arctic fox head patch in orange and white on the sleeve, rectangular packs in dense waxed cotton blend in khaki, forest green, navy, dark grey and mustard yellow, simple flat fronts, leather pull tags, bold colour block panels and straight-cut trousers with reinforced knees and slim zip pockets.'),
('Marimekko','Europe','1950s-present','textiles','In the style of Marimekko, fresh, cheerful Nordic modernism with bold large-scale graphic prints on cotton, giant poppy-like flowers in red, pink and orange on white, thick vertical and horizontal stripes in blue and white, round dot patterns, simple organic leaf shapes and flat colours with a hand-printed, hand-cut paper look and black outlined shapes. Loose boxy shapes, flat unshaded areas of colour, generous empty white space between motifs, and a bright, optimistic, unfussy mood.'),
('Orla Kiely','Europe','2000s','fashion','In the style of Orla Kiely, repeating retro 1960s inspired motifs such as a stem pattern of oval leaves on a thin stalk, multi-petal flowers and acorns, in a warm palette of orange, brown, mustard, olive, teal and cream, printed on laminated cloth with tan leather trim and across homewares. Neat grid layout, geometric nature, flat colour and a nostalgic mid-century Scandinavian look.'),
('Cath Kidston','Europe','1990s-2010s','homeware','In the style of Cath Kidston, sweet, cosy, nostalgic English vintage chintz with scattered cabbage roses in red, pink and blue, ditsy sprigs, spotty polka dots, ticking stripes and cherries, printed on cotton and oilcloth with a cheerful cottage feel. Cream or pale duck egg backgrounds, fresh red, powder blue and pink, trimmed with gingham, with vintage enamel details and 1950s housewife charm.'),
('Hunter','Europe','1950s-present','footwear','In the style of Hunter, tall waterproof rubber with a smooth glossy finish and a slight sheen in deep green, navy, black or bright seasonal colours, a rounded toe, an adjustable buckle strap at the back of the calf, a stitched-on fabric loop, a red tab logo on the heel, textured matte vulcanised seams and a thick tread sole. British countryside and festival look.'),
('Clarks','Europe','1950s-present','footwear','In the style of Clarks, relaxed mod and workwear comfort in soft napped suede in sand, brown, olive and navy, a crepe rubber soft sole in light honey gum colour, an ankle-height two-eyelet lace-up, thick apron toes, polished leather with a buckle strap, soft rounded toes and comfortable stitched construction. Understated, honest shapes with no decoration, muted natural colours and a lived-in, easygoing feel.'),
('Stetson','North America','1860s-present','hats','In the style of Stetson, rugged Western frontier icon with wide-brimmed felt in silver belly, tan, brown and black, a high pinched tall crown with a centre dent, a flat grosgrain ribbon band around the base with a small bow on the side, stiff curled brim edges and a sweatband interior. Also woven straw and fedora forms. A rounded, dignified silhouette.'),
('Pendleton','North America','1900s-present','textiles','In the style of Pendleton, earthy, cosy and graphic rugged Pacific Northwest lodge style with wool in Native-inspired geometric patterns of bold stepped diamonds, triangles, chevrons and stripes in saturated red, turquoise, mustard, black, cream and navy, woven in thick tight wool with fringed or bound edges. Tartan and plaid wool shirts with a woven label sewn at the side.'),
]
